<title>USA: Wynn's to tender for up to 1.1 mln shares.</title>
<headline>Wynn's to tender for up to 1.1 mln shares.</headline>
<dateline>ORANGE, Calif 1997-03-24</dateline>
<text>
<p>Wynn's International Inc said Monday that it will begin a Dutch Auction tender for up to 1.1 million shares, or about eight percent, of its issued and outstanding common stock, beginning Wednesday, March 26.</p>
<p>The purchase price will no more than $25 and not less than $22 a share, net to the seller in cash, the company said.</p>
<p>The offer will expire at midnight April 22, unless it is extended, the company said.</p>
<p>Wynn's shares closed Monday up 3/4 at 22-7/8.</p>
</text>
